OL,3,GNEWSAM60 back open after incident
OL,4,Acaused 50-minute delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of the M60 was closed in both
OL,7,Fdirections, leading to long delays.
OL,9,FDrivers were warned by National
OL,10,FHighways to expect delays of more than
OL,11,F50 minutes after the stretch of
OL,12,Fmotorway between Junction 17 at
OL,13,FPrestwich and Junction 18 at Simister
OL,14,FInterchange was closed.
OL,16,FNational Highways said at 18:45 GMT
OL,17,FGreater Manchester Police was dealing
OL,18,Fwith an incident.
OL,20,FDiversions were in place during the
OL,21,Fincident. All lanes have since been
OL,22,Freopened.
